{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "model",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Request model\n\nSend prepared context.\n\nRetry transient HTTP failures only before streaming starts.",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "stop",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stop — during any active stage\n\nCancel active work and invalidate pending approvals.\nCompleted changes remain.\nTerminate terminal process groups; close MCP clients.",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Run Lifecycle — current baseline\n\nExisting documented behavior.\nStart the new design here:\n[[Run Lifecycle - Text Only.canvas]]\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]\n\n[[Harness Design]]",
      "x": -280,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "limits",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Check budgets\n\nWithin time, step, tool and context limits?",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "recovery",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Restart after interruption\n\nRebuild context from visible messages and recorded tool outcomes.\n\nNever replay unfinished tool calls.",
      "x": 2640,
      "y": 800,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 10 · Return outcome\n\nAdd the tool result or error to model context, then check budgets before the next model step.",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "wait",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Wait for user\n\nAllow once → execute.\nDeny → tool error.\nStop → cancel the run.",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Draft choices recorded separately\n\nNew messages steer.\nKeep/move locked while running.\nStop keeps completed edits (D-067).\nAutomatic restoration is deferred.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 1125,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 275,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "validate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 7 · Validate action\n\nCheck tool name, arguments and permissions.",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "approval",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 8 · Approval needed?\n\nFor an otherwise permitted action, determine whether user approval is required.",
      "x": 1640,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Prepare context\n\nLoad identity, memory, instructions and history. Prepare available tools.",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · Receive message\n\nStart one run for the selected agent.",
      "x": -140,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "failure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Failure / limit reached\n\nEnd the run and close MCP clients.\n\nRedact provider errors; preserve partial text and completed activity.",
      "x": 670,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "stream",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · Process response\n\nStream text and collect tool proposals.\n\nA response can contain both.",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 5,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "calls",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6 · Tool calls?\n\nDoes the response propose any tool actions?",
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "complete",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Complete\n\nFinish the turn and commit native state.\n\nClose MCP clients.",
      "x": 2760,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "execute",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 9 · Execute tool\n\nPerform the permitted action.\n\nNever automatically retry a tool action.",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
